      "writtenOn": "2025-01-13T17:45:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As best as I can tell this is the same pattern as RasterPathAtlas uses, just with multiple mask renders. I believe RasterMaskHelper::drawShape()/drawClip() does the translation handling for us.",
      "parentUuid": "3183dddf_db69f1d2",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 255,
        "startChar": 0,
